    "r0c5": {
      "en": "<align=\"left\">When a character's Composure is below 50\\u002c suffers 1 stack of Thunder Marsh Divine Power whenever moving on Thunder Marsh.\\nAt the start of battle against White Loong or Little White Loong\\u002c each stack of Thunder Marsh Divine Power inflicts 2 to 4 Internal Injuries to a random part; for each stack of Internal Injuries exceeding a part's endurance limit\\u002c 6 Health is lost (up to 36 Health lost).</align>",
      "cn": "<align=\"left\">人物的冷静低于50时，每次在雷泽地形上移动，将受到1层雷泽神力影响。\\n在与白龙、小白龙战斗开始时，每层雷泽神力将使人物受到2至4的随机部位内伤；内伤每超出部位承受上限1层，损耗6点健康（最多损耗36健康）。</align>",
      "ru": null,
      "status": "pending",
      "srcHash": "4d0676f536b83766",
      "engine": null,
      "updatedAt": null
